    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30841" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἶδαρ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, 
